  "전담 세무사와 1:1 실시간 채팅으로 빠르고 정확하게 해결해 드립니다.": "We provide quick and accurate solutions through 1:1 real-time chat with a dedicated tax accountant.",
  "신청 자격 · 4가지 조건": "Eligibility for application · 4 conditions",
  "4가지 중 하나라도 해당되면 환급 신청 가능합니다": "If any of the four conditions apply, you can apply for a refund.",
  "청년 소득세 90% 감면 제도안내 자세히 알아보기": "Learn more about the 90% income tax reduction system for youth.",
  "맨 처음에는 한국어를 몰라서 인증앱을 어떻게 깔아야 하나 걱정부터 앞섰어요. 그런데 이지텍스리펀드의 자세한 안내를 하나하나 따라하다 보니 인증에 성공했구요. 결과는 대박! 제가 받을 수 있는 금액이 310만원이나 되더라구요. 신청 후 2달 뒤에 어김없이 국세청에서 입금되었습니다. 여러분 두려워 마세요!": "At first, I was worried about how to install the authentication app because I didn't know Korean. However, as I followed the detailed instructions of Easytex Refund step by step, I was able to get certified successfully. The result is amazing! The amount I could receive was 3.1 million won. Two months after application, the deposit was received from the National Tax Service without fail. Everyone, don’t be afraid!",
  "솔직히 처음엔 사기인 줄 알고 의심했어요. 하지만 국세청 공식 데이터를 안전하게 가져온다는 설명을 보고 용기를 냈죠. SMS 인증이 조금 복잡했지만 그림 가이드 덕분에 성공했고, 정확히 8주 뒤에 225만원이 통장으로 들어왔습니다. 정말 믿을 수 있는 서비스예요.": "To be honest, I was skeptical at first, thinking it was a scam. However, I took courage after seeing the explanation that official data from the National Tax Service would be safely retrieved. The SMS authentication was a little complicated, but thanks to the picture guide, I succeeded, and exactly 8 weeks later, 2.25 million won was deposited into my bank account. This is a truly reliable service.",
  "이름 대소문자랑 띄어쓰기 때문에 항상 실패했는데, 여기서 알려준 대로 하니까 바로 통과됐어요! 한국어가 서툴러도 그림만 보면 누구나 할 수 있습니다. 185만원이라는 큰 돈이 생겨서 너무 행복합니다. 우즈벡 친구들에게도 다 추천하고 있어요.": "I always failed because of the name case and spacing, but when I did what you said here, it passed right away! Even if your Korean is not good, anyone can do it just by looking at the pictures. I am very happy because I made a lot of money, 1.85 million won. I am recommending it to all my Uzbek friends.",
  "인증앱 설치가 외국인에겐 제일 큰 장벽인데, 이 앱은 그걸 아주 쉽게 풀어서 알려줍니다. 보안도 확실해서 개인정보 유출 걱정도 없었어요. 한 달 반 만에 278만원 환급받았습니다. 포기하지 마시고 꼭 도전해 보세요!": "Installing an authentication app is the biggest barrier for foreigners, but this app makes it very easy. Security was secure, so there was no need to worry about personal information being leaked. I received a refund of 2.78 million won in one and a half months. Don't give up and give it a try!",
  "인도네시아": "Indonesia",
  "처음엔 내 정보를 넣는 게 무서웠어요. 하지만 암호화 기술과 무저장 원칙을 보고 신뢰가 생겼습니다. 인증 성공하고 조회해보니 142만원이나 있었네요! 실제로 돈이 입금되는 걸 확인하니 정말 감격스러웠습니다. 이지텍스리펀드 팀 감사합니다.": "At first, I was scared to enter my information. However, I gained trust after seeing the encryption technology and no-storage principle. After successful verification, I checked and found that I had 1.42 million won! I was really thrilled to see that the money was actually deposited. Thank you, Easytex Refund team.",
  "네팔 친구들은 세금을 돌려받을 수 있다는 사실조차 몰랐어요. 저도 긴가민가하면서 시작했는데 300만원 행운을 얻었습니다! 인증 과정이 조금 힘들 수 있지만 자세히 설명된 대로만 하면 저 같은 외국인도 충분히 성공할 수 있어요.": "My Nepali friends didn't even know that they could get their taxes back. I also started with Gingaminga and was lucky enough to win 3 million won! The certification process may be a little difficult, but if you follow the detailed instructions, even a foreigner like me can succeed.",
  "통신사 인증이 항상 문제였는데, 여기서 알려준 팁 덕분에 드디어 해결했습니다. 소액이라고 생각했는데 95만원이나 들어오니 기분 최고네요! 외국인을 위한 이런 서비스가 있어서 정말 다행입니다. 여러분도 본인의 권리를 찾으세요.": "I always had a problem with carrier authentication, but thanks to the tips you provided here, I finally solved it. I thought it was a small amount, but it felt great to receive 950,000 won! I'm really glad that there is a service like this for foreigners. You too, find your rights.",
  "신청하고 나서 정말 돈이 들어올까 매일 확인했어요. 정확히 약속한 날짜에 국세청에서 입금 알림이 왔을 때 소리를 질렀습니다! 212만원 환급 성공! 인증앱 때문에 포기하지 마세요. 차근차근 따라하다 보면 행운이 올 거예요.": "After applying, I checked every day to see if the money would really come in. I screamed when I received a deposit notification from the National Tax Service on exactly the promised date! Successful refund of 2.12 million won! Don't give up because of the authentication app. If you follow it step by step, you will be lucky.",
  "러시아": "Russia",
  "보안이 제일 중요했는데 이 앱은 보안 보증서까지 있어서 안심하고 사용했습니다. SMS 인증 방법이 상세해서 외국인인 저도 5분 만에 끝냈어요. 168만원 환급금 받고 고향 부모님께 선물 보냈습니다. 정말 감사합니다!": "Security was the most important thing, and this app even came with a security guarantee, so I could use it with peace of mind. The SMS authentication method was detailed, so even as a foreigner, I completed it in 5 minutes. I received a refund of 1.68 million won and sent a gift to my parents in my hometown. thank you!",
  "미얀마 친구들이 사기 아니냐고 걱정했는데 제가 먼저 받고 증명했습니다! 115만원 통장에 찍히는 순간 다들 놀랐죠. 인증이 막힌다면 AI 비서에게 물어보세요. 정말 친절하게 알려줍니다. 모두 꼭 해보세요!": "My friends in Myanmar were worried that it was a scam, but I received it first and proved it! Everyone was surprised the moment 1.15 million won was recorded in the bank account. If authentication is blocked, ask the AI ​​assistant. This is really kind information. Everyone must try it!",
